1 NAME Martinus Olai /Nordeman/
2 GIVN Martinus Olai
2 _MARNM Nordeman
2 NICK Martin
2 NICK Nortman
1 NAME Martin Nordeman
1 NAME Martin Olofsson /Nordeman/
2 GIVN Martin Olofsson
2 SURN Nordeman
1 NAME Martin Nordeman
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 JUL 1636
2 PLAC Nordvik
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Nora
3 CITY Kramfors
3 STAE Ångermanland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 JAN 1684
