2 CONT Names may have been updated to reflect profiles that were already part of Geni.com The only link that was not on Geni was Sophie Burman and as we had witness testimony to the church records the curators on Geni accepted the linkag
2 CONC e and Sophie was added as a daughter to Jondis and Margaret Burstrom (Unend)  Our research started with Kirsten's son Peder Andersson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin Nordstrom Feb. 6, 2019
2 CONT
2 CONT Ifølge " Blixerne i Jemtland" af Henning Sollied , var Lauritz Mogensen Blix gift med Kirsten Eriksdatter, datter af den bekendte reformator Hr. Erik Andersson, sognepræst til Oviken og provst i Jemtland.
