2 CONC allius<br />K&ouml;n: Man<br />F&ouml;delse: 22 apr 1695 - Sunnanvik, Skatelov, Kronobg, Swed.<br />Vigsel: Make/Maka: Anna Christina Helin - 1718<br />Vigsel: Make/Maka: Montana Scharp - 1730<br />D&ouml;d: 3 jan 1754 - St. Kolab
