2 CONC tnant 1790
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the Colonel-Propriator of the 18th Line Infantry Regiment from 27th of December 1791 until his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf Patrick Stuart was fighting during 1799 in Italy and on the 18th of September he faught at the battle of Savigliano with his Ist and IIIrd  Battalion. Total manpower of 2363 soldiers.
