1 NAME John Henry Fock, 2nd Baron de Robeck
1 NAME Johan Henrik // 2nd Baron de Robeck
2 GIVN Johan Henrik
2 SURN Fock
2 NSFX 2nd Baron de Robeck
1 SEX M
