2 CONT In 1848, on June 27, the undersigned were called to prepare the will for Catharina Jonsdotter in Aspeå, who died on the 12th of this month, and left behind sons Jacob Matsson in Bredvik and Mats Matsson in Aspeå, Daughters Stina C
2 CONC ajsa married to Bonden Pehr Sjöberg in Lögdeå, Anna Helena married to Farmer Pehr Nilsson in Rönholm and Brita Margareta married to Farmer Jon Jonsson in Ledusjö, Also deceased son Jon Matsson's minor children, Mathias, Johannes, 
2 CONC Jonas and Pehr, of which the right of the latter was protected by its guardian named Pehr Sjöberg. After being told about the legal surrender of the property, a record and valuation was made as follows.
